<title>UK: EIB sets 2.0 billion Lux franc 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 2.0 billion Lux franc 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Generale du Luxembourg, Banque Internationale a Luxembourg, Credit Communal/Gemeentekredit and Generale Bank.  BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    05.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.80    PAY DATE    05.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (M) 50-250    PRAECIPIUM  0.175</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
